x --- VN presentation setup - REQUIRED before the first dialogue line, and
x --- easy to get wrong (the engine's defaults render an INVISIBLE textbox):
x ---   assetpath: image paths in this script resolve relative to this prefix;
x ---              without it they load from "" and fail silently.
x ---   textbox/namebox sprite + positions: must be set explicitly.
x --- Positions are in GUI units (design resolution x2 - e.g. 2560x1440 for a
x --- 1280x720 design). Values below match the other shipped games.
assetpath assets/
textbox sprite gui/textbox1.png
namebox sprite gui/namebox1.png
textbox position 1280 1230
textbox text position 150 1095
namebox position 490 1015
textbox wrapWidth 1000

x --- Demo dialogue: replace with your opening scene. `name` sets the speaker
x --- shown in the namebox (use  name  with no argument for narration).
